    "detailed_description": "<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >This game is a single player, the 1990s style RPG game.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The volume and screen size can be controlled in the title screen.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >The pixel art and retro BGM makes you nostalgic. The demon king is so strong that your strategy will be needed.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Playing time: 4 hours \uff5e 12 hours</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Ending: The game has 1 ending.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story: It's fiction about parallel universe of Japan</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ></p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >You can get some hints to clear this game by many NPC on the way to adventure.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Finally your goal is to reach a map where has the demon castle.</p><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Explore lots of maps and progress the story, and then defeat the demon king.</p>",
